{# All slider settings render as items of ONE flat accordion (General,
   Layout & Spacing, Behavior, Arrows, Pagination, Autoplay, Translations,
   Slides) — no nested cards/accordions. Section templates append their
   accordion-items here with data-bs-parent="#vanssa-slider-sections".

   vanssa-form-context: toolbar-driven visibility of locale sections on edit
   pages. slider-settings: dependent-field gating for the settings items. #}
<div class="col-12 vanssa-slider-admin" data-controller="vanssa-form-context slider-settings">
    <div class="accordion" id="vanssa-slider-sections">
        {% hook 'sections' %}
    </div>
</div>
